#ASSERT `s 29 the definition of a term names a thing` "Act" `In an enactment` "an Act of the Legislature"
#ASSERT `s 29 the definition of a term names a thing` "Act" `In an enactment` "an ordinance or proclamation made before 1871, that has the force of law"
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 29 the definition of a term names a thing` "Act" `In an enactment` "something the Act does not list"
        BECAUSE "the definition does not list the thing: 'includes' leaves the list open, and a meaning given in words is not tested here against a thing"
#ASSERT elem "when referring to past legislation" (`s 29 the conditions a definition of a term carries` "Act" `In an enactment`)

